cue0103568
00:34:49.000 --> 00:34:51.000
The first could only be one.

cue0103569
00:34:51.000 --> 00:34:53.000
The second could be second.

cue0103570
00:34:53.000 --> 00:34:55.000
But not the first.

cue0103571
