cue0103775
00:44:36.000 --> 00:44:37.000
Put it out.

cue0103776
00:44:38.000 --> 00:44:40.000
And some water is going to remain here on Earth.

cue0103777
00:44:40.000 --> 00:44:42.000
And somehow there is a pressure

cue0103778
00:44:42.000 --> 00:44:44.000
between what there is

cue0103779
00:44:44.000 --> 00:44:47.000
below and what God pushes above.

cue0103780
00:44:48.000 --> 00:44:50.000
And that is going to be called the atmosphere.

cue0103781
00:44:53.000 --> 00:44:55.000
All that makes a space.

cue0103782
00:44:56.000 --> 00:44:58.000
Somehow there was a force of pulling

cue0103783
00:44:58.000 --> 00:45:00.000
and it breaks the space.

cue0103784
00:45:01.000 --> 00:45:03.000
And now there is

cue0103785
00:45:03.000 --> 00:45:05.000
a space.

cue0103786
00:45:05.000 --> 00:45:07.000
That creates space.

cue0103787
00:45:07.000 --> 00:45:09.000
Interesting.

cue0103788
00:45:09.000 --> 00:45:11.000
Here for the universe you see that the space

cue0103789
00:45:11.000 --> 00:45:13.000
is not something...

cue0103790
00:45:13.000 --> 00:45:15.000
It's not the absence of something.

cue0103791
00:45:15.000 --> 00:45:17.000
It's not something dead.

cue0103792
00:45:17.000 --> 00:45:19.000
It's not something geometric.

cue0103793
00:45:19.000 --> 00:45:21.000
But it's like two forces pulling

cue0103794
00:45:21.000 --> 00:45:23.000
in different directions.

cue0103795
00:45:23.000 --> 00:45:25.000
Creating a space.

cue0103796
00:45:27.000 --> 00:45:29.000
And rakia literally means...

cue0103797
00:45:29.000 --> 00:45:31.000
It doesn't mean space like in English.

cue0103798
00:45:32.000 --> 00:45:34.000
The rakia in Hebrew means to stretch.

cue0103799
00:45:34.000 --> 00:45:36.000
It stretches.

cue0103800
00:45:36.000 --> 00:45:38.000
Like you are making pulling.

cue0103801
00:45:40.000 --> 00:45:42.000
And it creates...

cue0103802
00:45:42.000 --> 00:45:44.000
By doing this pulling

cue0103803
00:45:44.000 --> 00:45:46.000
it creates a hyperspace.

cue0103804
00:45:46.000 --> 00:45:48.000
There is a pull from above

cue0103805
00:45:48.000 --> 00:45:50.000
and a pull from below.

cue0103806
00:45:50.000 --> 00:45:52.000
Between these two pulls

cue0103807
00:45:52.000 --> 00:45:54.000
there is a hyperspace.

cue0103808
00:45:54.000 --> 00:45:56.000
But the word in Hebrew for space, rakia,

cue0103809
00:45:56.000 --> 00:45:58.000
is to stretch, to pull.

cue0103810
00:45:59.000 --> 00:46:01.000
Very interesting.

cue0103811
00:46:03.000 --> 00:46:05.000
Now, it says,

cue0103812
00:46:05.000 --> 00:46:07.000
let it be rakia.

cue0103813
00:46:07.000 --> 00:46:09.000
They talk of mind.

cue0103814
00:46:09.000 --> 00:46:11.000
By himadil, the mind, the mind.

cue0103815
00:46:12.000 --> 00:46:14.000
And therefore let it be a separation.

cue0103816
00:46:15.000 --> 00:46:17.000
But here the word madil

cue0103817
00:46:17.000 --> 00:46:19.000
doesn't mean...
